decision beforehand prevents a null or uncertain outcome from being hidden simply because it does not support an exciting optimization headline."]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"id":"deep-dive","className":"article-prose deep-dive","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"The clock is often taking credit for the creative"}],[["$","$1b","0",{"children":[["$","p","0",{"children":["Picture an illustrative workflow: the team schedules routine explainers in the morning and saves its strongest demonstrations for the evening. Evening posts then receive more views. The dashboard has found an association, but the scheduling habit offers a competing explanation. Better material and a different time arrived together. Moving every explainer to the evening would not necessarily reproduce the demonstrations' response. Before declaring a magic hour, inspect who chose each slot, which formats were assigned to it and whether posts were measured after the same elapsed time."]}]]}]],["$","figure",null,{"className":"editorial-diagram diagram-compare","children":[["$","figcaption",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mono acid","children":"THE IDEA, UNPACKED"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Three explanations for an evening spike"}]]}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"diagram-items","children":[["$","li","Timing",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"diagram-index","children":"01"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Timing"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The audience may be more available then."}],false]}]]}],["$","li","Selection",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"diagram-index","children":"02"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Selection"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The team may reserve stronger work for that slot."}],false]}]]}],["$","li","Maturity",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"diagram-index","children":"03"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Maturity"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Older posts may have had more time to accumulate views."}],false]}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"diagram-caption","children":"Editorial model: a way to reason about the process, not measured platform results."}]]}],["$L1c"]]}],"$L1d",false,"$L1e","$undefined","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22"]}],"$L23"]}]
